# Session state, written by the Stop hook into whatever folder a session runs in. It names the
# local temp path, the session id and the files that session touched. Per-machine, never a
# deliverable, and this repo is PUBLIC. Two of them were published before this rule existed.
.caddis/session-state.md
.caddis/session-state/
.caddis/relay.md
.caddis/relay/
.caddis/hook-errors.jsonl

